      "content": "the silence sounds almost better than this. but it's hard to just... let go. everything i've ever done, everything i've built, it's all gonna be gone anyway. it feels so pointless. is there even a way to face this without just being a coward? like, is there a better way to handle it than just waiting around for the gates to break?",
